      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Clinical and biological symptoms of neuroleptospirosis are misleading. We report a 62-year-old man, without any risk factor, suffering from febrile headache with a pseudotumoral cerebral spinal fluid due to neuroleptospirosis. Thereby, we present useful diagnostic assays and their practical interest."},
